+|---|---:|---|---:|
+| R2A06: positive control | 5 минут | Exit 0 | 1 |
+| **R2A07: expired plan** | **31 минута** | **Exit 0** | **1** |
+| **R2A08: clock rollback / future timestamp** | **−60 минут** | **Exit 0** | **1** |
