+# R3.1 inputs/API mapping
+
+No commits, push, branches, worktree, PR, staging/index (including git add -N), merge, tag, release or deploy; no remote messages/mutations, real sudo/APT/systemd/SSH/UFW/Docker daemon, OAuth/provider/model/credentials/VM/VPS. These bans apply to any later AI-agent prompts. No agents were delegated.
+
